    dayNumber: 0
    lines:
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: So....
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: So?
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: I heard about your dojo, what an ass
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: 'Hey, He''s still my Sensei man

'
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Hell Nah! Man you are good, and he benifitted from that. How many
        new students did he get cuz you won tournaments
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: ....
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: 'So what now ?

'
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: I dont know, Recover, focus on work, maybe?
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: There are other dojos out there you know?
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: 'Yeah?Name 1 that would take in a cripple like me '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Shut up da. You're not a cripple, First of all thats rude to people
        with actual disabilities.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Secondly, My sensei would take you in.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: But your dojo is more about Karate and self help than about tournaments,
        You know thats not my style
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Thats BS. Listen, you cant give up, this is an option . You need
        to learn to fight again...
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: Bro I know how to figh...
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: 'Thats not what I mean. You have to change it, You need to fight
        different, Like it or not, your injury is a part of you.  '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 0
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: My sensei knows his shit. he can help. Join us. I haven't ever seen
        you give up on anything yet, I wont let you start now.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 0
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: 'Alright, fine! seems like its my only option for now anyway. '
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 0
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Thats ma boy. Alright Lemon tea before we head back? My treat!!
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 0
